 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": "rec",
   "start": 1.8,
   "end": 4.045,
   "text": "March 2019. Eight in the morning."
  },
  {
   "scene": "rec",
   "start": 4.495,
   "end": 7.241,
   "text": "You hit record, and talk to the person you will become."
  },
  {
   "scene": "rec",
   "start": 7.941,
   "end": 9.98,
   "text": "Future me, are you still playing guitar?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "years",
   "start": 11.88,
   "end": 14.484,
   "text": "Over the years, you leave more messages for later."
  },
  {
   "scene": "years",
   "start": 14.934,
   "end": 19.819,
   "text": "In June 2021, a prediction: In two years, I will have my own studio."
  },
  {
   "scene": "years",
   "start": 20.269,
   "end": 24.503,
   "text": "On New Year's Day, a promise: I promise I will call Dad every Sunday."
  },
  {
   "scene": "years",
   "start": 24.953,
   "end": 30.35,
   "text": "And one night in September 2023, a worry: I am scared this job will swallow me."
  },
  {
   "scene": "forgot",
   "start": 31.7,
   "end": 32.88,
   "text": "Then life happens."
  },
  {
   "scene": "forgot",
   "start": 33.33,
   "end": 37.423,
   "text": "The memos pile up. Two hundred and twelve of them, next to fifty-two notes."
  },
  {
   "scene": "forgot",
   "start": 37.873,
   "end": 39.384,
   "text": "Nobody goes back to listen."
  },
  {
   "scene": "forgot",
   "start": 39.834,
   "end": 43.006,
   "text": "And you can't search for a promise you no longer remember making."
  },
  {
   "scene": "turn",
   "start": 44.356,
   "end": 46.72,
   "text": "Most archive tools let you ask your past."
  },
  {
   "scene": "turn",
   "start": 47.17,
   "end": 48.81,
   "text": "This one lets your past ask you."
  },
  {
   "scene": "turn",
   "start": 49.66,
   "end": 51.027,
   "text": "This is Past Me Asks."
  },
  {
   "scene": "turn",
   "start": 51.477,
   "end": 53.366,
   "text": "A Skill for the UGREEN AI NAS."
  },
  {
   "scene": "today",
   "start": 54.816,
   "end": 59.965,
   "text": "It goes through the memos and notes you choose, and finds the messages past you left for the future."
  },
  {
   "scene": "today",
   "start": 60.415,
   "end": 63.497,
   "text": "Each one comes back word for word, with its real date."
  },
  {
   "scene": "today",
   "start": 63.947,
   "end": 65.564,
   "text": "And then, past you gets to ask."
  },
  {
   "scene": "today",
   "start": 66.014,
   "end": 71.189,
   "text": "In 2021, you expected your own studio by 2023. What happened?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "answer",
   "start": 72.539,
   "end": 76.53,
   "text": "You answer in your own words: typed, or recorded as a new Now Me memo."
  },
  {
   "scene": "answer",
   "start": 77.13,
   "end": 80.431,
   "text": "Not my own, but I share one with Lea since 2024."
  },
  {
   "scene": "decide",
   "start": 81.781,
   "end": 83.593,
   "text": "Kept? Not kept? Still open?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "decide",
   "start": 84.493,
   "end": 85.505,
   "text": "Only you decide."
  },
  {
   "scene": "decide",
   "start": 85.955,
   "end": 89.458,
   "text": "It never scores you, never judges you, and never gives advice."
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 90.908,
   "end": 92.66,
   "text": "Then the other messages wait for you."
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 93.11,
   "end": 94.377,
   "text": "How did this promise go?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 94.827,
   "end": 96.73,
   "text": "What would you tell the person who said this?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 97.18,
   "end": 99.003,
   "text": "And that question from 2019."
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 100.153,
   "end": 100.712,
   "text": "Are you?"
  },
  {
   "scene": "others",
   "start": 102.012,
   "end": 106.813,
   "text": "If you are not ready to answer yet, that's fine. It simply saves: not answered yet."
  },
  {
   "scene": "dialogue",
   "start": 108.513,
   "end": 113.546,
   "text": "When you say yes, it saves past and present side by side, in one dated dialogue."
  },
  {
   "scene": "dialogue",
   "start": 113.996,
   "end": 116.95,
   "text": "Exact quotes. Real dates. Nothing invented."
  },
  {
   "scene": "people",
   "start": 118.4,
   "end": 121.269,
   "text": "It's made for anyone with years of memos and notes."
  },
  {
   "scene": "people",
   "start": 121.719,
   "end": 127.137,
   "text": "Ana turns 35. Past her wanted to have run a marathon by then. She marks it: kept."
  },
  {
   "scene": "people",
   "start": 127.587,
   "end": 135.054,
   "text": "Jonas promised to call his dad every Sunday. He writes what happened, and leaves it unmarked. It's the first thing he has written about it."
  },
  {
   "scene": "people",
   "start": 135.504,
   "end": 141.974,
   "text": "Sofia answers the worries she had about her teaching job, and the Skill makes no comment on whether they were justified."
  },
  {
   "scene": "people",
   "start": 142.424,
   "end": 149.072,
   "text": "And Priya, deciding whether to move abroad again, reads her own words from before, during and after her last move."
  },
  {
   "scene": "trust",
   "start": 150.422,
   "end": 151.958,
   "text": "And it treats your past with care."
  },
  {
   "scene": "trust",
   "start": 152.408,
   "end": 158.712,
   "text": "It reads only the folders you name, never changes a memo or a note, and writes nothing until you say yes."
  },
  {
   "scene": "outro",
   "start": 160.662,
   "end": 163.022,
   "text": "Most archive tools let you ask your past."
  },
  {
   "scene": "outro",
   "start": 163.472,
   "end": 165.122,
   "text": "This one lets your past ask you."
  },
  {
   "scene": "outro",
   "start": 165.572,
   "end": 170.246,
   "text": "Past Me Asks. For Bring Memories to Life, by Mert Toprak and Daghan Leflef."
  },
  {
   "scene": "outro",
   "start": 171.746,
   "end": 174.01,
   "text": "So, tell me. Are you still playing guitar?"
  }
 ]
}